              <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[매개 변수 2]&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;월별&apos; THEN &apos;`&apos; + right(STR(YEAR([Parameters].[C_End_Date 매개 변수])),2)+ &apos;.&apos;+ MID(str([Parameters].[C_End_Date 매개 변수]),6,2)&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;주별&apos; THEN STR(ISOWEEK([Parameters].[C_End_Date 매개 변수])) + &apos;W&apos;&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;일별&apos; THEN REPLACE(MID(str([Parameters].[C_End_Date 매개 변수]),6,5),&apos;-&apos;,&apos;/&apos;)&#13;&#10;END' />
